.TH YES "1" "April 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
yes \- output a string repeatedly

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yes
[\fI\,STRING\/\fR]...

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Repeatedly output a line with all specified STRING(s), or 'y'.

.SH OPTIONS
None.

